    },
    "decay": {"5d": -0.00119889, "10d": 0.00969891, "20d": -0.01367847, "40d": -0.03110568},
    "regime_notes": "Strongly horizon-specific and regime-dependent: IC was -0.04944 in 2020-2024, +0.03277 in 2027-2029, -0.03284 in 2030-2032, and +0.04878 in 2033-2034. Small 15-asset universe warrants conservative interpretation.",
